**/ios/ServiceDefinitions.json
**/ios/Runner/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*

# macOS related
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral
**/macos/Flutter/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.dart
**/macos/Pods/

# Linux related
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral

# Windows related
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/Generated.props

